			"notes": "## New Origins\n\n### Moth\n\n- Heals when near a light source\n- Immune to fall damage\n- 2 pixels tall\n- Can fly unless wet\n- Deals extra damage to entities with the glowing effect\n\n## Origin Changes\n\n### Gnome\n\n- Will now bring up a separate screen to select a subclass after choosing gnome. Rather than being based on the first tool you use.\n- \"Adaptive\" is now referred to as \"Selective Talent\"\n\n## Fixes\n\n#7  - JEI doesn't show recipes"
