			"notes": "### New Origins\n\n- Added Moobloom (Suggested by rjdoesntexist)\n- Added Hoglin\n- Added Zoglin\n- Added Halfling\n- Added Striderling (Suggested by MeetSofa)\n\n### Origin Changes\n\n- Raccoon no longer spawns phantoms\n- Warden now has a sonic boom\n- Warden's blindness is now a bit less intense\n- Kobold now has a silk touch ability\n- Skeleton will no longer be targeted by Skeletons\n- Wither Skeleton will no longer be targeted by Skeletons and Wither Skeletons\n- Gnome can now evolve into a Halfling using axes\n\n### Item Changes\n\n- Golem Totem recipe was slightly altered to fit with 1.20's new smithing system\n\n### Technical Changes\n\n- Updated to 1.20.1\n- Modified the Mob Neutrality power type to be global\n- Changed the old Mob Neutrality to \"LegacyMobNeutrality\", because some mobs have different AI\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fixed some inconsistencies in the text"
		},
