			"notes": "### Origin Changes\n\n- Raccoons slowness and weakness from being in open spaces is now shorter\n- Raccoons now have an overlay on screen when using Sly Cooper\n- Fairy is no longer immune to effects due to compatibility issues with mods\n- Fairy now applies levitation to a target rather than having attack damage\n- Stoneling and Vampires evolution hints are slightly more helpful.\n\n### Item Changes\n\n- Umbrellas now protect all origins from sunlight and rain\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fixed Issue #5 - Every item is missing it's texture\n- \"Raccoon\" is now spelled correctly on the origin select screen"
